ery\":1}\ue201\n\n2\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn591445product3\",\"OWC Express 1M2\"]\ue201\n\n\\$109.99 \u00b7 Micro Center\n\nBest premium fanless option\n\nUSB4 40Gbps, up to approximately 3,836 MB/s advertised, substantial aluminum heatsink, silent operation.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.microcenter.com/product/692550/owc-express-1m2-usb4-external-ssd-enclosure?utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn591445product24\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n3\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn591445product24\",\"ACASIS 40Gbps Active Cooling Enclosure\"]\ue201\n\n\\$84.15 \u00b7 newegg.com\n\nBest for long transfers\n\nIntegrated fan, Thunderbolt compatibility, useful for sustained writes and large backups.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.newegg.com/acasis-m-2-ssd-enclosure-hard-drive-enclosure-for-m-2-drive/p/0VN-006R-00086?item=9SIC6G8M5D7400&utm_medium=ai_search&utm_campaign=ais_openai_product_feed&negg_topt=1015&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"entity_refs\":[\"turn591445product7\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n4\\. \ue200entity\ue202[\"turn591445product7\",\"OWC Express 1M2 80G\"]\ue201\n\n\\$199.99 \u00b7 Adorama\n\nBest for Thunderbolt 5\n\nUSB4 80Gbps, advertised speeds exceeding 6,000 MB/s on compatible systems.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View product\ue202https://www.adorama.com/owc-express-1m2-usb4-nvme-ssd-enclosure-silver/p/owcusv21m2?utm_meedium=feed&utm_medium=feed&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n## Which speed do you actually need?\n\n| Interface | Typical maximum real-world speed | Best use |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| USB 3.2 10Gbps | 900\u20131,050 MB/s | Budget, backups |\n| USB 3.2 20Gbps | 1,600\u20132,000 MB/s | Midrange Windows PCs |\n| USB4 40Gbps | 2,800\u20133,900 MB/s | Fast external |"},{"p":"/message/metadata/safe_urls/3","o":"